{"id": "69277", "title": "小东西", "author": "嘉人", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 43, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69277.htm", "intro": "许意宁是宠儿，别提她父亲和两个母亲，只姐姐哥哥们就把她宠到天上去。\r\n\r\n许意宁是孩子中的英雄，比她的大的侄子们都要在其麾下冲锋陷阵，小子，姑奶奶现在不屑打人，侄儿们，上！\r\n\r\n后来许意宁长大了恋爱了，小子，我喜欢你，你，可喜欢我吗？你的答案只能有一个！——完了，追男朋友用打的好像不管用呀……\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n本文系甜文或八卦文或狗血文，请无视标签吧！……\r\n\r\n新春大吉，万事如意！", "base": "files/article/html/69/69277", "chapters": [{"title": "归来", "file": "10595173.html", "available": false}, {"title": "打算", "file": "10595174.html", "available": false}, {"title": "初见", "file": "10595175.html", "available": false}, {"title": "冲突", "file": "10595176.html", "available": false}, {"title": "心动", "file": "10595177.html", "available": false}, {"title": "会意", "file": "10595178.html", "available": false}, {"title": "态度", "file": "10595179.html", "available": false}, {"title": "端午", "file": "10595180.html", "available": false}, {"title": "拥抱", "file": "10595181.html", "available": false}, {"title": "纠缠", "file": "10595182.html", "available": false}, {"title": "出生", "file": "10595183.html", "available": false}, {"title": "初恋", "file": "10595184.html", "available": false}, {"title": "冤孽", "file": "10595185.html", "available": false}, {"title": "暴力", "file": "10595186.html", "available": false}, {"title": "信仰", "file": "10595188.html", "available": false}, {"title": "岔路", "file": "10595189.html", "available": false}, {"title": "开始", "file": "10595190.html", "available": false}, {"title": "冲动", "file": "10595191.html", "available": false}, {"title": "报复", "file": "10595192.html", "available": false}, {"title": "误会", "file": "10595193.html", "available": false}, {"title": "算计", "file": "10595194.html", "available": false}, {"title": "人心", "file": "10595195.html", "available": false}, {"title": "离别", "file": "10595196.html", "available": false}, {"title": "乖张", "file": "10595197.html", "available": false}, {"title": "争执", "file": "10595198.html", "available": false}, 